# One lap of the test track (#1629), as the pad plays it: the left stick
# steers (`axis`, -1 full left), the right trigger is the throttle and the
# left the brake (`pull`, 0 to 1). playtests/referee.rhai judges it.
#
# Recorded by playtests/pilot.rhai, a closed-loop driver, and replayed here
# open-loop: record it again when a change to the handling is meant to move
# the lap (pilot.rhai says how). Every change is at 0.08, 0.18, ... s, 20 ms
# before a 1/30 s frame, so it lands on the same fixed step at 1/30, 1/60
# and 1/144 s frames (crates/flint-player/tests/vehicle.rs says why).
#
# Measured 2026-11-27 (Windows, RTX 4070 box; the run needs no GPU): the lap
# is 12.09 s at 1/60 s frames, 12.10 at 1/30 and 12.09 at 1/144, the kart at
# most 0.84 m off the centre line, 0.67 s in the air off the ramp.

# Launch: full throttle down the start straight
0.08  axis  LeftStickX    0.0
0.08  pull  RightTrigger2 1.0
0.08  pull  LeftTrigger2  0.0
2.98  pull  RightTrigger2 0.9
3.18  pull  RightTrigger2 0.8
3.28  pull  RightTrigger2 0.5

# The hairpin: brake from 23 m/s to 12.5, turn in, full lock round it
3.38  pull  RightTrigger2 0.0
3.38  pull  LeftTrigger2  0.4
3.48  pull  LeftTrigger2  0.3
3.58  pull  RightTrigger2 0.5
3.58  pull  LeftTrigger2  0.0
3.68  pull  RightTrigger2 0.0
3.68  pull  LeftTrigger2  0.4
3.78  axis  LeftStickX    -0.145
3.78  pull  LeftTrigger2  0.5
3.88  axis  LeftStickX    -0.193
3.88  pull  LeftTrigger2  0.4
3.98  axis  LeftStickX    -0.288
3.98  pull  LeftTrigger2  0.3
4.08  axis  LeftStickX    -0.382
4.08  pull  RightTrigger2 0.7
4.08  pull  LeftTrigger2  0.0
4.18  axis  LeftStickX    -0.668
4.18  pull  RightTrigger2 0.6
4.28  axis  LeftStickX    -0.715
4.38  pull  RightTrigger2 0.5
4.48  axis  LeftStickX    -0.905
4.68  axis  LeftStickX    -0.858
4.68  pull  RightTrigger2 0.6
4.78  axis  LeftStickX    -1.0

# Unwind onto the back straight, full throttle
5.58  axis  LeftStickX    -0.858
5.58  pull  RightTrigger2 1.0
5.68  axis  LeftStickX    -0.668
5.78  axis  LeftStickX    -0.477
5.88  axis  LeftStickX    -0.335
5.98  axis  LeftStickX    -0.24
6.08  axis  LeftStickX    -0.193
6.18  axis  LeftStickX    -0.145
6.28  axis  LeftStickX    -0.098
6.38  axis  LeftStickX    0.0

# Straight on over the ramp (its lip at 7.5 s) and onto the sand at 8.9 s
6.88  axis  LeftStickX    0.098
7.08  axis  LeftStickX    0.0
7.28  axis  LeftStickX    0.098
7.38  axis  LeftStickX    0.0

# The closing turn, off the sand, then back over the line at 12.1 s
9.38  pull  RightTrigger2 0.6
9.48  axis  LeftStickX    -0.145
9.48  pull  RightTrigger2 0.5
9.58  axis  LeftStickX    -0.335
9.58  pull  RightTrigger2 0.0
9.58  pull  LeftTrigger2  0.4
9.68  axis  LeftStickX    -0.43
9.68  pull  RightTrigger2 0.6
9.68  pull  LeftTrigger2  0.0
9.78  axis  LeftStickX    -0.335
9.78  pull  RightTrigger2 0.9
9.88  axis  LeftStickX    -0.62
9.88  pull  RightTrigger2 0.8
9.98  axis  LeftStickX    -0.905
9.98  pull  RightTrigger2 0.6
10.08 pull  RightTrigger2 0.5
10.18 axis  LeftStickX    -1.0
10.18 pull  RightTrigger2 0.6
10.38 axis  LeftStickX    -0.953
10.48 axis  LeftStickX    -1.0
